# 🌦️ Weather Forecast AI

An AI-powered Weather Forecasting project built using Python and Machine Learning. It uses historical weather data to train a Random Forest Classifier and predict weather conditions based on atmospheric parameters.

## 🚀 Project Overview

The Weather Forecast AI project analyzes historical weather information and applies machine learning techniques to predict weather conditions.

The model is trained using weather-related features such as temperature, humidity, wind speed, visibility, pressure, and precipitation type.

It uses a Random Forest Classification algorithm to learn patterns from historical weather data and generate predictions.

## ✨ Features

- **Weather Data Processing:** Extracts and processes historical weather datasets.
- **Data Preprocessing:** Cleans the dataset and handles categorical values using Label Encoding.
- **Machine Learning:** Uses Random Forest Classifier for weather prediction.
- **Model Training:** Trains the model using historical weather records.
- **Model Persistence:** Saves the trained model using Pickle.
- **Weather Prediction:** Predicts weather conditions using atmospheric input parameters.
- **Label Mapping:** Converts encoded prediction outputs back into readable weather conditions.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Python | Core programming language |
| Pandas | Data manipulation and analysis |
| NumPy | Numerical operations |
| Scikit-learn | Machine learning and preprocessing |
| Random Forest | Weather classification |
| Matplotlib | Data visualization |
| Pickle | Saving and loading trained models |

